{"2337560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spanky \"Bat-a-Swing\"", "steam_appid": 2337560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE RHYTHM IN YOUR BLOOD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in, feel the rhythm, challenge the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/1c8eb53a853c6ca335bead14bb3128d6.poster.avif?t=1779563450\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/1c8eb53a853c6ca335bead14bb3128d6.webm?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/1c8eb53a853c6ca335bead14bb3128d6.mp4?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanky “Bat-a-Swing” is a platformer where music isn’t just part of the experience: it is the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a city where everything moves to the beat of a dynamic electro-swing soundtrack, the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >blends a visual style inspired by classic 1930s animation with gameplay that draws from the great</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >classics of the genre. The result is a vibrant, one-of-a-kind world that pulls you in with thumping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >basslines, off-beat grooves, and sharp snare hits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything around you moves in sync, like a living orchestra: enemies, platforms, traps, the city’s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mechanisms… everything is music! It is up to you to decide whether to ride this driving rhythm and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >flow through levels like a perfectly choreographed performance… or resist it and carve your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >through chaos on your own terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO METRONOPOLIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metronopolis is a big, lively city: loud, relentless, always on beat. But it wasn’t always like this. It</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >used to be a great place to live… at least until the new mayor, Metrognome, took power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, rhythm is law. Every citizen, every street, every system must follow the tempo imposed by his</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >endless soundtrack. Many have given in and accepted this drastic change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not Spanky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short-tempered bat with a knack for invention, Spanky has turned his oversized ears into</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >powerful speakers and decided to rebel against this musical madness. If the city runs on rhythm,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >then he will use that rhythm as a weapon. His mission? Fight the mayor’s goons, climb the ranks of</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metronopolis, and give Metrognome a well-deserved lesson to put an end to the noise once and for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes… press that big, shiny “OFF” button once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/e475e9a7f25c3e99b120caee277bb2e1.poster.avif?t=1779563450\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/e475e9a7f25c3e99b120caee277bb2e1.webm?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/e475e9a7f25c3e99b120caee277bb2e1.mp4?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENEMIES, PLATFORMS, AND LOTS, LOTS OF MUSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Spanky’s shoes (and ears!) and explore the districts of Metronopolis, each defined by its</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >own unique visual and musical identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through hand-crafted levels packed with personality and style, in platforming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sections built around the rhythm of the music. Face enemies and traps that follow musical patterns,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meet a cast of quirky characters, and unlock new abilities to push your skills even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between moving platforms, acrobatic routes, and timing-based challenges, every level will test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your precision, sense of rhythm, and ability to adapt. And when it’s time to face the bosses… get</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ready to turn every encounter into a full-blown performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused, stay on beat, and don’t give up: Metronopolis needs someone to break the rhythm…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and finally bring peace back to the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.poster.avif?t=1779563450\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.webm?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.mp4?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D platformer built around rhythm and music</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual style inspired by classic 1930s cartoons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct areas with unique visual and musical identities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 personality-packed levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 quirky, hand-animated characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main bosses plus one epic final showdown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ original music tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectibles and secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in music player to enjoy unlocked track </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE RHYTHM IN YOUR BLOOD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in, feel the rhythm, challenge the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/1c8eb53a853c6ca335bead14bb3128d6.poster.avif?t=1779563450\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/1c8eb53a853c6ca335bead14bb3128d6.webm?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/1c8eb53a853c6ca335bead14bb3128d6.mp4?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanky “Bat-a-Swing” is a platformer where music isn’t just part of the experience: it is the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a city where everything moves to the beat of a dynamic electro-swing soundtrack, the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >blends a visual style inspired by classic 1930s animation with gameplay that draws from the great</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >classics of the genre. The result is a vibrant, one-of-a-kind world that pulls you in with thumping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >basslines, off-beat grooves, and sharp snare hits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything around you moves in sync, like a living orchestra: enemies, platforms, traps, the city’s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mechanisms… everything is music! It is up to you to decide whether to ride this driving rhythm and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >flow through levels like a perfectly choreographed performance… or resist it and carve your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >through chaos on your own terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO METRONOPOLIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metronopolis is a big, lively city: loud, relentless, always on beat. But it wasn’t always like this. It</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >used to be a great place to live… at least until the new mayor, Metrognome, took power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, rhythm is law. Every citizen, every street, every system must follow the tempo imposed by his</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >endless soundtrack. Many have given in and accepted this drastic change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not Spanky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short-tempered bat with a knack for invention, Spanky has turned his oversized ears into</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >powerful speakers and decided to rebel against this musical madness. If the city runs on rhythm,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >then he will use that rhythm as a weapon. His mission? Fight the mayor’s goons, climb the ranks of</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metronopolis, and give Metrognome a well-deserved lesson to put an end to the noise once and for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes… press that big, shiny “OFF” button once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/e475e9a7f25c3e99b120caee277bb2e1.poster.avif?t=1779563450\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/e475e9a7f25c3e99b120caee277bb2e1.webm?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/e475e9a7f25c3e99b120caee277bb2e1.mp4?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENEMIES, PLATFORMS, AND LOTS, LOTS OF MUSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Spanky’s shoes (and ears!) and explore the districts of Metronopolis, each defined by its</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >own unique visual and musical identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through hand-crafted levels packed with personality and style, in platforming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sections built around the rhythm of the music. Face enemies and traps that follow musical patterns,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >meet a cast of quirky characters, and unlock new abilities to push your skills even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between moving platforms, acrobatic routes, and timing-based challenges, every level will test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your precision, sense of rhythm, and ability to adapt. And when it’s time to face the bosses… get</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ready to turn every encounter into a full-blown performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused, stay on beat, and don’t give up: Metronopolis needs someone to break the rhythm…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and finally bring peace back to the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.poster.avif?t=1779563450\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.webm?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.mp4?t=1779563450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D platformer built around rhythm and music</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual style inspired by classic 1930s cartoons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 distinct areas with unique visual and musical identities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 personality-packed levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 quirky, hand-animated characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main bosses plus one epic final showdown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ original music tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectibles and secrets to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in music player to enjoy unlocked track </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Spanky &quot;Bat-a-Swing&quot; is a 3D rhythm based platformer, inspired by 1930s cartoons and electro swing music! Enter and explore Metronopolis, where everything and everyone moves and dances on the beat of music. Help Spanky the Bat teach Mayor Metrognome a lesson!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a